A||||4||Gold87SE||98 Mustang GT vs. 87 Fiero SE Performance Comparison||||1||
Z||000000||Gold87SE||09-04-2000||01:43 AM||||Could somebody please give me a performance comparison between a stock 98 Mustang GT 4.6 vs a stock 87 Fiero SE 2.8? They're both automatics. I know the 98's are one of the slower years but my friend has a 98 Mustang GT and he talks about the car like it's god and he thinks that if he race's me he'll be able to make a complete fool out of me.||||reg||1
Z||000001||86SE||09-04-2000||02:05 AM||||Just raced one with my auto 2.8.  He hung at my door til about 75 and pulled 1 car legnth on me and thats all.  They have 250 HP and around 250 lbs torque.<P>As soon as you hit third gear, you won't have enough power to keep up with the mustang.  Just ride out 1st and 2nd gear to about 5500 RPM.  You should be able to beat him to 60.<P>Good luck!<P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero<BR>Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention||||reg||10
Z||000002||Gold87SE||09-04-2000||02:28 AM||||I already know that I can destroy him in handling but I haven't gotten in a serious race with him yet. I just followed him through a windy road once and he nearly killed himself trying to keep with me.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Gold87SE||09-04-2000||02:28 AM||||I mean he followed me through the windy road.||||reg||1
Z||000004||BBBAD GT||09-04-2000||01:03 PM||||The 96-98 4.6 V8 Stangs had from 205-215 flywheel hp rated from the factory.  In 1999, they revised the heads/intake and bunch of other stuff and got 260 flywheel hp.  A 98 auto GT should do the 1/4 mi in the high 15 low 16's.  The only mods that are most likely on it (that are commonly available) are exhaust (mufflers and maybe no cats), K&N, and maybe pulleys.  If its bone stock, then I'd say you have a good chance of keeping up with him, if your V6 is in good running condition, but I bet your auto will hold you back some. <BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">    <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
